      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/35/eng@/~cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/35/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) as renumbered the following subsections: “(2) Where interest is awarded under subsection (1) for recovery of damages under section 6a of the Limitation Act 1953 [Act 254], the interest may be given for the whole or any part of the period between the starting date and the date of the judgement. (3) For the purposes of subsection (2), “starting date” has the meaning assigned to it in the Limitation Act 1953.”. Amendment of section 28a"
      }
    },
